DSH WorkBuddy — compatibility fork
==================================

This repository is a fork of `dsh-workbuddy`
(https://github.com/Faide-cyber/dsh-workbuddy), revision 9951d25 (v1.0.12).

Upstream copyright: Copyright (c) 2026 Faide-cyber, released under the MIT License.
The full upstream license text is kept unchanged in LICENSE and applies to the
whole work, including the modifications below.

Modifications in this fork (Copyright (c) 2026 busizhanghan), MIT-licensed on the
same terms:

1. Widened the `@deepseek-ai/dsh-*` peer dependency ranges from the exact pin
   `0.2.0-rc.2` to `>=0.2.0-rc.2 <0.3.0-0`, so DeepSeek Harness 0.2.1-rc.2 no
   longer rejects the plugin at load time.
2. Rewrote the client-name string `DeepSeek Harness` to `DeepSeek-Harness` in the
   outgoing chat request body, which the upstream service accepts as a known
   client name.
3. Renamed the published package to `@bushizhanghan/dsh-workmate`, including the
   client module id, the `cordis.patch.yml` insert name, the CLI command name and
   the documentation. The model provider id (`workbuddy-ai`) is unchanged.

Nothing else is changed relative to upstream 1.0.12. Reproducible diffs live in
`patches/`. If upstream ships an equivalent fix, prefer the official package.
